 "title": "Resources - River Valley Cooperative",
 "text": "Resources - River Valley Cooperative\nOpens in a new window Opens an external website Opens an external website in a new window\nThis website utilizes technologies such as cookies to enable essential site functionality, as well as for analytics, personalization, and marketing. To learn more, view the following link: Privacy Policy\nManage Preferences\nStorage Preferences\nMain\nUtilities\nMeet RVC\nMembership Application\nBoard of Directors\nRVC News\nInsights Magazine\nProducts & Services\nYieldVance\nAgronomy\nGrain\nFeed\nEnergy\nRVC Edge\nResources\nDepartment Resources\nCustomer Portal\nThank You\nCareers\nJob Listings\nBenefits\nInternships\nScholarships\nFinance\nNews\nLocations\nContact Us\nPortal Login\nFinance\nNews\nLocations\nContact Us\nResources\nMEMBERSHIP RESOURCES\nMembership Application & W-9 Tax Form\nThank you for your interest in River Valley Cooperative. As a cooperative, we allocate profits at the end of our fiscal year (August 31st) with our member-owners based on their volume of business. A portion of these profits are paid out in cash, and the non-cash portion becomes preferred stock assigned in the member’s name and held by the Cooperative to be paid out when authorized by the Board of Directors.\nIf you are interested in becoming a member, please complete an application form and form W-9. Membership costs are $200 for a Class A farming operation and $100 for a Class B non-farming operation.\nDownload PDF document: Membership Application & W-9 Tax Form\nACCOUNT APPLICATION FORMS\nTo do business with River Valley Cooperative , a completed application is required. Please select the application type that matches your intended business with RVC:\nACCOUNT APPLICATION\nHOME HEAT APPLICATION\nGRAIN ONLY APPLICATION\nEach link will take you to our digital application , which requires an email address to complete.\nNeed Help While Applying? If you have questions at any point, please contact: Malea Marshall – Member Relations Specialist - Phone: (563) 285‑1714.\nPrefer a Printable Form? If you are unable to complete a digital application, we also offer PDF fillable/printable forms.\nACCOUNT APPLICATION\nHOME HEAT APPLICATION\nGRAIN ONLY APPLICATION\nCompleted forms may be returned by:\nMail:\nRiver Valley Cooperative\nPO Box 256\nEldridge, IA 52748\nEmail: accountsreceivable@rvc.ag\nACH AUTHORIZATION FORM\nComplete this form if you are interested in signing up for automatic payment withdrawals for your monthly bill.\nDownload PDF document: ACH Authorization Form\nMembership Forms\nMail completed membership and/or account application forms to:\nRiver Valley Cooperative\nPO Box 256\nEldridge, IA 52748\nQuestions?\nIf you have any questions about becoming a member, please call (563) 285-1714 and ask for Malea Marshall.\nOnline Customer Portal\nThe online experience from River Valley Cooperative puts a wealth of information at your fingertips. Available online and as an application for Android and Apple devices.\nLEARN MORE\nGET THE APP\nRESOURCES BY DEPARTMENT\nENERGY RESOURCES\nENERGY RESOURCES\nPropane or Heating Emergency\nIf you encounter a propane or heating emergency, call our 24-Hour Propane Emergency Hotline: (563) 357-0816 .\nOrder Propane\nFind the online order form here .\nEnergy Questions?\nFor more information about our energy solutions contact: 800-730-2838 .\nFEED RESOURCES\nFEED RESOURCES\nFeed Safety Data Sheets\nDownload PDF documents:\nSafety Data Sheet (SDS) Feed\nSafety Data Sheet (SDS) Whole Grain\nGRAIN RESOURCES\nGRAIN RESOURCES\nGrain ACH Authorization Form\nAs a continuing effort to provide our customers with the most efficient service possible, River Valley Cooperative offers Direct Deposit for your grain checks. You have the option of picking up your settlement sheets or you can have them emailed to you.\nDownload PDF document: Grain ACH Authorization Form\nMarketEdge Program Communication Sign-up\nCommunication\nReceive emailed grain comments every morning and afternoon\nReceive updates on government report data and market implications\nReceive marketing bulletins and strategies\nClick to Subscribe\nEquivalent Price Calculator Tool\nPlug in your data into the shaded boxes on the downloadable spreadsheet to see the price equivalent on your crops.\nDownload XLXS: Equivalent Price Calculator Tool\nGrain ACH Questions?\nIf you have any questions regarding this program, please call 563-285-1714 .\nConnect with River Valley Cooperative\nCENTRAL OFFICE:\n254 E 90th Street\nDavenport, IA 52806\nMAIL:\nPO Box 256 Eldridge,\nIowa 52748\nDIRECT:\n866-962-7820\ninfo@rivervalleycoop.com\nMEET RVC\nMembership Application\nBoard of Directors\nRVC News\nInsights Magazine\nPRODUCTS & SERVICES\nAgronomy\nGrain\nFeed\nEnergy\nRESOURCES\nDepartment Resources\nCustomer Portal\nCAREERS\nJob Openings\nBenefits\nInternships\nOur Culture\nFinance\nLocations\nContact Us\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 River Valley Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
